{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d0fedf10-dc1c-5a4c-bedf-1d9611853c68",
    "name": "BancoERP Nexus · E2 Diseño e Implementación QA (46 casos) · v2 re-prueba cierre E3 · 00_Preparacion_REP01 (subconjunto)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Colección trazable a los 46 casos del Documento E2 (E2_Documento_Diseno_Implementacion_Nexus.docx). Una carpeta por requerimiento y una subcarpeta por caso TC-REQxx-xxx con sus pasos. Requiere el entorno QA aislado (docker-compose.qa.yml) y MockData_Fixtures_Nexus.sql. Plantillas de diseño: NO equivale a una ejecución; los resultados formales se registran en la Entrega 3."
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "for (const k of [\"baseInterna\",\"basePublica\"]) {",
          "  const v=pm.variables.get(k);",
          "  if (![\"http://localhost:15141\",\"http://localhost:15254\"].includes(v)) {",
          "    pm.execution.skipRequest(); throw new Error(\"Solo URLs del entorno QA aislado (docker-compose.qa.yml)\");",
          "  }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Preparación (tokens)",
      "description": "Ejecutar primero. Requiere MockData_Fixtures_Nexus.sql cargado. Guarda tokens en el ambiente.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login qa_admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseInterna}}/api/auth/login",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"qa_admin\",\n  \"password\": \"{{qaPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "let j={}; try { j=pm.response.json(); } catch(e) { j={}; }",
                  "pm.test(\"Prep: HTTP 200\", ()=>pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));",
                  "if(j.token) pm.environment.set(\"token_admin\", j.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login qa_cajero",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseInterna}}/api/auth/login",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"qa_cajero\",\n  \"password\": \"{{qaPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "let j={}; try { j=pm.response.json(); } catch(e) { j={}; }",
                  "pm.test(\"Prep: HTTP 200\", ()=>pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));",
                  "if(j.token) pm.environment.set(\"token_cajero\", j.token);",
                  "if(j.refreshToken) pm.environment.set(\"refresh_cajero\", j.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login externo qa.banco.externo@nexus.test",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{basePublica}}/api/external/auth/login",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"qa.banco.externo@nexus.test\",\n  \"password\": \"{{qaPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "let j={}; try { j=pm.response.json(); } catch(e) { j={}; }",
                  "pm.test(\"Prep: HTTP 200\", ()=>pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200]));",
                  "if(j.accessToken) pm.environment.set(\"token_externo\", j.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}